:name: STM32F4DISCOVERY - uji PWM hardware (Renode)
:description: Memuat firmware dan mencetak konfigurasi register TIM4 serta pin GPIOD.
:description: Jalankan dari root project: renode -e "i @renode/blinky.resc"

using sysbus
mach create "stm32f4discovery"

machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/stm32f4discovery_blinky.repl

sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/disco_f407vg/firmware.elf

python """
from Antmicro.Renode.Time import TimeInterval
e = emulationManager.CurrentEmulation
m = self.Machine
sb = m['sysbus']
def rd(a):
    try:
        return '%08X' % (sb.ReadDoubleWord(a) & 0xFFFFFFFF)
    except Exception:
        return 'ERR'
B = 0x40000800  # TIM4
e.PauseAll()
for i in range(0, 4):
    if i > 0:
        e.RunFor(TimeInterval.FromMilliseconds(1))
    print('t=%d ms | TIM4 CR1=%s PSC=%s ARR=%s CNT=%s CCMR1=%s CCER=%s CCR1=%s CCR2=%s CCR3=%s CCR4=%s | GPIOD MODER=%s AFR1=%s' % (
        i, rd(B + 0x00), rd(B + 0x28), rd(B + 0x2C), rd(B + 0x24), rd(B + 0x18),
        rd(B + 0x20), rd(B + 0x34), rd(B + 0x38), rd(B + 0x3C), rd(B + 0x40),
        rd(0x40020C00), rd(0x40020C24)))
e.PauseAll()
"""
quit
